{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1KI",
  "chapter": 7,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But Solomon was building his own house thirteen years, and he finished all his house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He built also the house of the forest of Lebanon; its length ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred cubits, and its breadth fifty cubits, and its hight thirty cubits, upon four rows of cedar pillars, with cedar beams upon the pillars.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " covered with cedar above upon the beams, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "lay",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on forty-five pillars, fifteen ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a row.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " windows in three rows, and light ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against light ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " three ranks.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And all the doors and posts ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " square, with the windows: and light ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against light ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " three ranks.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made a porch of pillars; its length ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fifty cubits, and its breadth thirty cubits: and the porch ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before them: and the ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "other",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " pillars and the thick beams ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then he made a porch for the throne where he might judge, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the porch of judgment: and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " covered with cedar from one side of the floor to the other.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And his house where he dwelt ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "had",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " another court within the porch, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " was of the like work. Solomon made also a house for Pharaoh's daughter, whom he had married, like to this porch.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " costly stones, according to the measures of hewn stones, sawed with saws, within and without, even from the foundation to the coping, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on the outside towards the great court.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the foundation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " costly stones, even great stones; stones of ten cubits, and stones of eight cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And above ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " costly stones, after the measures of hewn stones, and cedars.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the great court around ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with three rows of hewn stones, and a row of cedar beams, both for the inner court of the house of the LORD, and for the porch of the house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And king Solomon sent and brought Hiram out of Tyre.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a widow's son of the tribe of Naphtali, and his father ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a man of Tyre, a worker in brass: and he was filled with wisdom, and understanding, and ingenious to work all works in brass. And he came to king Solomon, and wrought all his work.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he cast two pillars of brass, each of eighteen cubits high: and a line of twelve cubits did encompass each of them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made two capitals ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " molten brass, to set upon the tops of the pillars: the hight of the one capital ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits, and the hight of the other capital ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " nets of checker-work, and wreaths of chain-work, for the capitals which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the top of the pillars; seven for the one capital, and seven for the other capital.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made the pillars, and two rows around upon the one net-work, to cover the capitals that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the top, with pomegranates: and so he did for the other capital.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the capitals that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the top of the pillars ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of lily-work in the porch, four cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the capitals upon the two pillars ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "had pomegranates",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " also above, over against the belly which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by the net-work: and the pomegranates ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " two hundred in rows around upon the other capital.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he set up the pillars in the porch of the temple: and he set up the right pillar, and called its name Jachin: and he set up the left pillar, and called its name Boaz.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And upon the top of the pillars ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lily-work: so was the work of the pillars finished.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made a molten sea, ten cubits from the one brim to the other: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " entirely round, and its hight ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits: and a line of thirty cubits encompassed it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And under the brim of it around ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knobs compassing it, ten in a cubit, compassing the sea around: the knobs ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cast in two rows, when it was cast.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It stood upon twelve oxen, three looking towards the north, and three looking towards the west, and three looking towards the south, and three looking towards the east: and the sea ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was set",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " above upon them, and all their hinder parts ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " inward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a hand-breadth thick, and its brim was wrought like the brim of a cup, with flowers of lilies: it contained two thousand baths.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made ten bases of brass; four cubits ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the length of one base, and four cubits the breadth of it, and three cubits the hight of it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the work of the bases ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "manner",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": They had borders, and the borders ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " between the ledges:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And on the borders that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " between the ledges ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lions, oxen, and cherubim: and upon the ledges ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a base above: and beneath the lions and oxen ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " certain additions made of thin work.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And every base had four brazen wheels, and plates of brass: and the four corners of it had undersetters: under the laver ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " undersetters molten, at the side of every addition.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the mouth of it within the capital and above ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a cubit: but the mouth of it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " round ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "after",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the work of the base, a cubit and a half: and also upon the mouth of it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " gravings with their borders, foursquare, not round.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And under the borders ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " four wheels; and the axletrees of the wheels ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were joined",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the base: and the hight of a wheel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a cubit and half a cubit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the work of the wheels ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " like the work of a chariot wheel: their axletrees, and their naves, and their fellies, and their spokes, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all molten.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " four undersetters to the four corners of one base: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the undersetters ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the very base itself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.7.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.7.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in the top of the base ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a round compass of half a cubit high: and on the top of the base its ledges and its borders ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
